 is to enhance shareholder value.\n\nIf the aforementioned stock is the acquired party, then it will be delisted from the platform, and positions will be closed at the average liquidation price. If the aforementioned stock is the acquirer, it will continue to be offered on our platform.\n\nPlease be aware that corporate actions may be subject to changes.\n\nTo review your account portfolio and stay informed about any updates, please click here: https://www.etoro.com/portfolio/overview\n\n\nThank you,\n\nThe eToroTeam","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-23T05:22:16.18Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/373662c9-d3cd-4f84-8a4a-7e823234aecf-2026-09-23.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/373662c9-d3cd-4f84-8a4a-7e823234aecf-2026-09-23.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"2078","symbolName":"SDR.L","displayName":"Schroders","updated":"2026-09-24T12:32:40.007Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":2078,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/sdr.l/80x80.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/sdr.l/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/sdr.l/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/2078/2078_042A5E_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#042A5E","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}}],"isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited"},"commentsData":{"reactionPaging":{"totalCount":0},"comments":[]},"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":2},"emotions":[{"type":"Like","id":"like_8bd63d40-b70c-11f1-8080-800102053d97_12564565","owner":{"id":"12564565","userna